# Cra's page probes (theme and background colour, Picture in Picture) answer through Cra Helper,
# never through the page's console: a site's DevTools showed __cra_bg:, __cra_theme: and
# __cra_pip: lines on every load. The fixture counts console calls and sees the theme probe run.
from://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/console.html
expect-log loaded file:
wait 3
from://action/pictureInPicture
wait 2
from://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"calls.length+':'+(probes>0)+':'+calls.join('|')"}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"0:true:"
